  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pax Christi Network in Latin America and Caribbean:  working together for social justice and peace.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The member organisations of the Latin America and Caribbean branch of Pax Christi have identified 3 areas of focus for 2012:  strengthening a Pax Christi infrastructure for peace from the grassroots, sustainability and peace, human rights and human security. Particular attention will be given to training in active non-violence, training in effective advocacy, conflict over natural resources (mining, water), climate change and violent conflicts, human trafficking, gender based violence and the implementation of Security Council Resolution 1325/1820.</narrative>
  </description>
